id, PENDING_DECISIONS, csm_id). Dump the raw recovered data to a local recovered_tickets.json file so we have a hard backup. [NEW] migrate_to_substrate.py A Python script that will: Load recovered_tickets.json. Initialize ExtrinsicSubmitter(use_mock=False
). Iterate over the recovered payloads and submit them to the blockchain via archive_ticket() and archive_csm(). Architect Portal (PQR Backend) [MODIFY] api_server.py Fully remove any lingering CockroachDB initialization logic (since it's dead). Ensure th
e 
