\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af46 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f46\insrsid7026199\charrsid7026199 \u10004\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid7026199\charrsid7026199  You can walk away from your keyboard
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af46 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f46\insrsid7026199\charrsid7026199 \u10004\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid7026199\charrsid7026199  Open the Architect Portal on your phone
